  "version": "2026.10.1",
  "notes": [
    "Layer 1 keyword rules. Deterministic, never skipped. See 03-classifier.md §2-§3 for matching semantics.",
    "word = whole word; phrase = whole words at both ends, internal whitespace matches [\\s\\-]+; prefix = word-start match; emoji = literal code point; regex = JS regex with 'iu' flags.",
    "Every pattern is matched against the basic, squeezed, deleet and despaced variants of the text. Patterns are squeezed the same way before matching the squeezed variant.",
    "There is NO exclusion list. Brief MUST: fire, burn, explode, overheat, thermal runaway, smoke, gas, danger, unsafe, injury, insurance, fire brigade => critical.",
    "Changes require a PR that passes tests/fixtures/classifier-testset.jsonl (keyword gate) and Owner approval."
